/* Simplified Chinese catalog. Keys mirror en.lproj exactly. Status glyphs
   (○ ● ◐ ✕) are unchanged; only the word is translated. Technical terms the
   user needs verbatim (claude, Claude Code, claude auth login, 终端,
   /Applications, config.json, .bak, worktree) and the product name
   "Claude RC Manager" stay untranslated. Apple's Simplified Chinese style:
   a space between Chinese text and embedded Latin terms or numerals, CJK
   punctuation (，。？). */

